        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baamori baulwa mwiie",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atoni-Seteki, omwami owa Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10.1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yerusalemu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mu siise esio Yerusalemu lwaba lukoba lwe Bayebusi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", aulila bali Yoshua aaba abukuule ne khukhwonakila elala lukoba lwa Ai lundi erire omwami walwo, nga nilwo aakhola khu Yeriko ne omwami walwo. Lundi aaulila bali babaandu be e Kibeoni baba bakholile endakaano eye kumuleembe ne Baisiraeli lundi baba babamenyilemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atoni-Seteki aria lukali sikila Kibeoni lwaba lukoba luboofu nga chingoba chichiindi chichaba ne babaami. Kibeoni lwaba lukoba luboofu khukhila lukoba lwa Ai, ne babaandu balwo baba be kamaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono Atoni-Seteki omwami owa Yerusalemu aruma likhuwa khu mwami Hohamu owa Heburoni, omwami Piramu owa Yarimuti, Yafia, omwami owe Lakishi, ne omwami Tebiri owa Ekironi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababoolela ali, “Yiicha munjeete mala khwibwaakale lukoba lwa Kibeoni, sikila babaandu balwo bakholile kumuleembe ne Yoshua ne babaandu ba Isiraeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaami baraano be Baamori: omwami owa Yerusalemu, omwami owa Heburoni, omwami owa Yarimuti, omwami owa Lakishi, ne omwami owa Ekironi, babuusia banamae babwe mala bacha e Kibeoni, balusira mala balwibwaakala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu be lukoba lwa Kibeoni barumira Yoshua likhuwa mu kambi eyaba e Kilikali bali, “Okhakhulekha tawe! Yiicha khangu okhuyeete mala okhuonie! Babaami boosi be Baamori babaamenya mu sibala sie bikulu babuusiisie alala banamae babwe mala bakhwibwakaale.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yoshua ne banamae bewe boosi, alala ne babaandu bewe be kamaani, baniina khukhwama e Kilikali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Yoshua ali, “Okhabariakho tawe. Namalile khukhua bukhili khale. Mbao khu nibo ocha khukhwima ebweeni wowo tawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siilo siosi Yoshua ne banamae bewe bakeenda khukhwama e Kilikali boola e Kibeoni, mala bebwaakala Baamori matundubiikha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhola Baamori bareenga ebweeni we banamae ba Isiraeli. Baisiraeli baberera e Kibeoni mala babatimania khubirira khu muyila khubira emwaalo owa Beti-horoni. Bachiililila khubaapa khukhwola ebunafubo e Aseka ne Maketa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nga Baamori ne baaba ne belukha banamae ba Isiraeli, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhola kamaarara kamaboofu khukhwama khwikulu kabapila khu ngila, khukhwola e Aseka mala bafwa. Bakali beerwa ne kamaarara khukhila nibo Baisiraeli beera ne embalu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endaalo niyo Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aaelesia Baisiraeli bukhili khu Baamori, Yoshua alomaloma ne Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ebweeni we Baisiraeli ali,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.1.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam. 1.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Enyanga yema alala ne kumwesi kwema khukhwola nga ekholo eya Isiraeli ne yeyaacha basiku babwe. Lino liaandikwa mu sitabu sia Yasiari lili; “Enyanga yema akari we likulu ne se yakwa khu ndaalo yoosi tawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se yabakhoo endaalo nga eyo namwe ekhabaakhoo endaalo ekiindi nga endaalo eyo niio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aaulila omundu tawe. Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi apanila Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma wa kano Yoshua ne banamae bewe bakobola mu kambi e Kilikali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoshua atiila babaami baraano be Baamori",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaami be Baamori baraano, kakhaba kario, baba beluukhe mala bekisile mwibina lie e Maketa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu mulala abanyoola, mala aboolela Yoshua niio bekisile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yoshua aloma ali, “Piringisia kamabaale kamaboofu kafuunikhe e muliango we libina elio. Rayo baliindi ebweeneyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne kakhali enywe mwabeene mukhekhalayo tawe. Tima khu basiku mala mubebwaakale khukhwamila enyuma, mukhabalekha boola mungoba chabwe tawe! Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe amuelesie bukhili khu nibo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua ne Baisiraeli beera basiku. Ne kakhali balala banyala khukhwilukhila mungoba chabwe chisire, khwirwa tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio babaandu boosi bakobola khu Yoshua bulayi mu kambi e Maketa. Mbao omundu yesi yesi mu sibala owakhakakho khukuta Baisiraeli tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yoshua aloma ali, “Ikulayo emuliango we libina mala mundeerere babaami baraano abo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako libina liekulibwa, ne babaami ba Yerusalemu, Heburoni, Yarimuti, Lakishi, ne Ekironi barusibwa enje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mala bayila babaami abo khu Yoshua. Yoshua alanga babaandu boosi ba Isiraeli. Aboolela bakhulu be banamae ba baaba ne bachile ne naye ali, “Yiicha siimbi mala mure bikele bienywe khu makosi ke babaami bano.” Nio becha siimbi mala bara bikele biabwe khu makosi ke babaami abo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yoshua ababoolela ali, “Mukharia namwe mwafwa kimiooyo tawe. Ba ne kamaani ne bunyindaafu, sikila kano niko Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi acha khukholela basiku benywe boosi nibo mulipana nabo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma wako, Yoshua eera babaami baraano abo mala abasuunga khu mirongooro kiraano. Basikala khu mirongooro ekio khukhwola ekolooba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oli enyanga echa khukwa, Yoshua arusia lilaka kimibili kiabwe kiasungulwa mala bakimwaata mwibina nimwo abeele baba ne bekisile. Bara kamabaale kamaboofu e muliango we libina. Kamabaale ako kasiilio khukhwola luno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoshua atasa khuaamba sibala sia Amori",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua aamba lukoba lwa Maketa endaalo eyo mala aluulila elala ne omwami walwo khulwe khurumikhira embalu. Abunisilia elala buli mundu mu lukoba olwo, mbao niye alekha tawe. Akhola khu mwami owa Maketa niko akhola khu mwami owa Yeriko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yoshua ne Baisiraeli boosi bacha khukhwama e Maketa boola mu lukoba lwa Libuna, mala balwibwaakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi lundi aelesia Baisiraeli bukhili khuula lukoba luno no mwami walwo. Beera bamenywa bamwo boosi khuramiakho akhaba omundu namulala yeng'ene tawe. Bakhola omwami walwo niko bakholela omwami owa Yeriko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma wa kano, Yoshua ne Baisiraeli boosi bacha khukhwama e Libuna bola khu lukoba lwa Lakishi, balukara mala balwibwaakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aelesia Baisiraeli bukhili khuula Lakishi mu ndaalo ekhola khabili eye liie. Baluulila elala khulwe khurumikhira embalu. Beera buli mundu walwo, nga nilwo bakhola Libuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami Horamu owa Keseri echa khuabina Lakishi. Yoshua amwiira ne babaandu bewe ne se abakhoo owarama tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio, Yoshua ne Baisiraeli boosi bacha khukhwama e Lakishi boola mu lukoba lwa Ekironi, balusira mala balwibwaakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baluaamba, endaalo eyo ne khuluulila elala khulwe khurumikhira embalu. Babunisilia elala buli omundu mu lukoba omwo endaalo eyo nga bakhola e Lakishi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma wa kano, Yoshua ne Baisiraeli boosi baniina khukhwama Ekironi khukhwola mu Heburoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balwibwaakala mala baluaamba. Baluulila elala ne omwami owe mu lukoba ne chingoba chalwo chindiiti, ne buli mundu khulwe khurumikhira embalu. Se baramiakho omundu tawe, nga bakhola khu Ekironi, balubunisilia elala nende buli mundu walwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yoshua ne Baisiraeli boosi bakobola e Tebiri mala balwibwaakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluaamba no mwami walwo ne chingoba chalwo chindiiti choosi. Bachiulila elala, nende buli mundu owalwo khulwe khurumikhira embalu. Se baramiakho omundu tawe. Bakholela Tebiri no mwami walwo nga nilwo bakholela Heburoni ne Libuna ne babaami balwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono Yoshua aula sibala sioosi. Akhila babaami be sibala sie mu bikulu bie ebukwe, ne mumaayo mwe bikulu bie mumbo, alala ne naabo be mungoongo lubeka lwe ebunafubo. Se alekhakho na mulala tawe. Buli mundu erwa. Lino nilio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi owa Isiraeli alaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua aula khukhwama e Kadeshi-barinea, lubeka lwe ebunafubo, khukhwola e Kasa ne sibala sioosi sia Kosieni khukhwola e Kibeoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua aula babaami be bibala bino bioosi mu khupana lulala, sikila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli, apanila Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma wa kano, Yoshua ne banamae bewe bakobola mu kambi e Kilikali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
